{"name":"Scarlet Past","hex":"#a53b3d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"scarlet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A brilliant red colour sometimes tinged with orange.","Cloth of a scarlet color."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a bright red colour.","Sinful or whorish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/scarlet"},{"term":"past","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The period of time that has already happened, in contrast to the present and the future.","The past tense."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having already happened; in the past; finished. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Following expressions of time to indicate how long ago something happened; ago."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/past"}],"entries":[{"title":"Past","blocks":[{"text":"The past is the set of all events that occurred before a given point in time. The past is contrasted with and defined by the present and the future. The concept of the past is derived from the linear fashion in which human observers experience time, and is accessed through memory and recollection. In addition, humans have recorded the past since the advent of written language."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Bouncing_ball_strobe_edit.jpg/330px-Bouncing_ball_strobe_edit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past"},{"title":"Scarlet (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Scarlet is a bright red color, sometimes with a slightly orange tinge. In the spectrum of visible light, and on the traditional color wheel, it is one-quarter of the way between red and orange, slightly less orange than vermilion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/52/RCMP-female-officer.jpg/330px-RCMP-female-officer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scarle